{'Test Purpose': 'Verify that the CT is able to request metadata information for a track other than currently playing one\nfrom the Virtual Filesystem when the TG supports a later profile version.', 'Initial Condition': '- The Lower Tester supports an SDP version that is greater than the current published version,\ne.g., AVRCP v1.9.\n   - The Lower Tester has all the bits in its Supported Features SDP attributes set, including those\nthat are RFA.\n   - A connection for control is established.\n   - The Lower Tester acting as TG is currently playing a track.', 'Test Procedure': 'Initiate the action on the CT to request metadata information for a track other than the currently\nplaying one from the Virtual Filesystem.', 'Expected Outcome': 'Pass verdict\nThe CT receives the correct metadata information for the desired track and can provide it to the\nUpper Tester.'}



