{'Test Purpose': 'Verify the Track Changed INTERIM response when no track is selected.', 'Initial Condition': '- The IUT is active as AVRCP TG role.\n   - No Track is currently selected on the IUT.', 'Test Procedure': 'The Lower Tester issues a valid RegisterNotification for the EVENT_TRACK_CHANGED.', 'Expected Outcome': 'Pass verdict\nThe IUT issues a correctly formatted RegisterNotification Interim Response for the\nEVENT_TRACK_CHANGED with the Identifier Parameter set to 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF.'}



