r tests\n(AVRCP/TG/CA/BV-08-C [Use the Imaging Property Object – TG], AVRCP/TG/CA/BV-10-C [Pull an\nImage as a Thumbnail – TG], AVRCP/TG/CA/BV-12-C [Pull a Thumbnail – TG] and\nAVRCP/TG/CA/BV-14-C [Pull a Native Image – TG]).'}



